# Dodge & Win — Closed Testing Program

Please follow these steps to join the closed test, install **Dodge & Win**, use the app, and provide your feedback.

---

### ⚠️ Before You Start
* You need an active **Google account / Gmail ID**.
* The email address you use to join the Google Group **must match** the Google account used on your Android device's Google Play Store.
* Ensure you are signed in with that specific Google account before proceeding.

---

### 📋 Step-by-Step Instructions

#### **Step 1 — Join the Google Group**
Open the Google Group link below to get authorized:
👉 [Dodge & Win Testers Group](https://groups.google.com/u/2/g/dodgeandwin-testersset)

1. Sign in with the Google account you will use for testing.
2. Click **Join group**.
3. Confirm that you have successfully joined the group.

---

#### **Step 2 — Join the Closed Test & Install the App**
After joining the Google Group, open the appropriate link below:

* 💻 **If joining from a PC / Laptop (Web):**  
  [Join Beta via Web Opt-in](https://play.google.com/apps/testing/com.winner.dodgeandwin)

* 📱 **If joining directly from an Android Phone:**  
  [Open in Google Play Store](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.winner.dodgeandwin)

> **Note:** The link will take you to Google Play. If you see an "Item not found" error, verify that you joined the Google Group in Step 1 using the exact same Google account.

---

#### **Step 3 — Use & Test the App**
After installing **Dodge & Win**, please actively test the app for **15 days**. 

Play the game multiple times and try out the features. Please report any:
* Bugs or unexpected behavior
* App crashes
* Gameplay issues
* UI problems or confusing elements
* Feature requests and suggestions for improvement

---

#### **Step 4 — Send Feedback**
To send your feedback directly from the app:
1. Open **Dodge & Win**.
2. Go to the **About** section.
3. Scroll down to the bottom.
4. Tap **Send Feedback**.
5. Enter your feedback and submit!

---

**Thank you for helping test Dodge & Win! Your feedback is invaluable to us.**
